# Pairs with ContactOnlyWhenAdmitted. The inbound rows lose their cap, so
# peer-chosen origins grow the state without bound.
MODULE: ReceiverContactRowsUncapped
TARGET: ContactOnlyWhenAdmitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a new inbound contact row is admitted past the cap
PERTURBS: ApplyRun

--- FIND
        record == result = "applied" /\ (<<t, o>> \in contact \/ Cardinality(contact) < Cap)
--- REPLACE
        record == result = "applied"
--- END